# GitHub Pages

Pushes to `main` publish https://mr-arpg.github.io/portefolio/.

After a requested change to this site is done, commit it and push `main`. Do not wait to be asked, and do not stop after the local edit.

Leave unrelated or unfinished work uncommitted. Do not push if the user said not to publish.
